  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "nb"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Abasajja abooluganda, ne bakadde bange, mumpulirize.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baawulira ng'ayogera Lwebbulaniya ne beeyongera okusirikira ddala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulo n'abagamba nti, \"Ndi Muyudaaya, nazaalibwa mu kibuga Taluso eky'omu Kirukiya, naye ne nkulira wano mu Yerusaalemi. Era mu kibuga muno mwe nayigira ne nzijjumbira amateeka gonna aga bajjajjaffe n'obwegendereza, nga njigirizibwa Gamalyeri. Nafubanga nnyo okuweesa Katonda ekitiibwa mu buli kye nakolanga, nga nammwe bwe mukola leero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayigganya abantu b'Ekkubo n'okubatuusa ku kufa, ne nkwata abasajja n'abakazi ne mbasibisa mu kkomera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Kabona Asinga Obukulu n'ab'Olukiiko Olukulu be bajulirwa bange. Kubanga nabasaba bawandiikire bannaabwe mu Damasiko ebbaluwa okunnyamba nkwate abaali eyo mbaleete wano mu Yerusaalemi nga mbasibye mu njegere mbaweeyo babonerezebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Naye mu ssaawa ez'omu ttuntu bwe nnali nga nsemberera Damasiko, amangwago ekitangaala eky'amaanyi ekyava mu ggulu ne kinjakira okunneetooloola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ngwa wansi ku ttaka, ne mpulira eddoboozi nga liŋŋamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Sawulo, Sawulo, onjigganyiza ki?'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.22.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ne mbuuza nti, 'Ani, Mukama wange?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 22:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"N'anziramu nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Nze Yesu Omunnazaaleesi gw'oyigganya.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be nnali nabo baalaba ekitangaala, naye eddoboozi ly'oyo eyayogera nange tebaaliwulira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ne mmubuuza nti, 'Nkole ki, Mukama wange?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 22:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Mukama waffe n'anziramu nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Yimuka ogende mu Damasiko, bw'onootuuka eyo ojja kutegeezebwa byonna bye nkutumye okukola.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bannange ne bankwata ku mukono ne bannyingiza mu Damasiko, kubanga ekitiibwa ky'ekitangaala kiri eky'amaanyi kyali kinzibye amaaso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Omusajja omu ayitibwa Ananiya, ng'atya Katonda era ng'agondera amateeka gonna ag'Ekiyudaaya, n'Abayudaaya bonna mu Damasiko nga bamussaamu ekitiibwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ajja okundaba n'ayimirira we ndi n'aŋŋamba nti, 'Owooluganda Sawulo, zibuka amaaso!' Mu ssaawa eyo yennyini ne nsobola okumulaba!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Awo n'aŋŋamba nti, 'Katonda wa bajjajjaffe akulonze otegeere by'ayagala era olabe Omutuukirivu we, era owulire okuyitibwa okuva mu kamwa ke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olituusa obubaka bwe mu bantu bonna ng'obategeeza by'olabye era ne by'owulidde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakano olinda ki? Situka obatizibwe onaazibweko ebibi byo nga bw'oyatudde erinnya lye.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ne nkomawo mu Yerusaalemi. Naye olunaku lumu bwe nnali mu Yeekaalu nga nsaba, ne mbeera ng'eyeebase,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nfuna okwolesebwa ne ndaba Mukama waffe ng'ayogera nange, n'aŋŋamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Yanguwa mangu ove mu Yerusaalemi, kubanga abantu ba wano tebajja kukkiriza bubaka bwo bw'onoobategeeza obufa ku nze.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ne nziramu nti, 'Naye Mukama wange, abantu bonna bamanyi nga bwe nagendanga mu buli kkuŋŋaaniro ne nzigyamu abakukkiriza, ne mbatwala ne bakubwa emiggo n'okusibibwa ne basibibwa mu kkomera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'omujulirwa wo Suteefano bwe yali attibwa nnali nnyimiridde awo era nga mpagira okuttibwa kwe, era nga ndabirira engoye z'abo abaali bamutta.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Naye Mukama waffe n'aŋŋamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Vva mu Yerusaalemi, kubanga nzija kukutuma mu bitundu bye wala mu baamawanga!' \"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.22.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pawulo Omuruumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibiina ky'abantu ne bawuliriza Pawulo okutuusa lwe yatuuka ku bigambo ebyo, bonna ne balyoka baleekaanira wamu nti, \"Mumuggyeewo! Mumutte! Tasaanira kuba mulamu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bawowoggana nnyo nga bwe bakasuka n'engoye zaabwe waggulu mu bbanga, ne bayoola enfuufu nga bagiyiwa mu bbanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukulu w'abaserikale n'ayingiza Pawulo munda mu nkambi yaabwe, n'alagira akubwemu embooko nga bwe bamubuuza ayogere omusango gwe yazzizza oguleetedde ekibiina kyonna okwecwacwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali bamugalamizza nga bagenda okumusiba bamukube, Pawulo n'abuuza omuserikale eyali amuyimiridde okumpi nti, \"Amateeka gabakkiriza okukuba omuntu Omuruumi nga temunnaba na kumuwozesa?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuserikale n'agenda eri omuduumizi waabwe n'amutegeeza nti, \"Kiki kino ky'ogenda okukola? Omusajja ono Muruumi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuduumizi w'abaserikale n'ajja n'abuuza Pawulo nti, \"Mbulira, oli Muruumi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 22:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pawulo n'amuddamu nti, \"Yee, bwe kiri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuduumizi w'abaserikale n'amugamba nti, \"Nange ndi Muruumi, naye nabusasulira ensimbi nnyingi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 22:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pawulo n'amuddamu nti, \"Nze mwe nazaalirwa!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaserikale abaali beetegese okumubuuza ne baseebulukuka ne bavaawo bwe baategeera nga Pawulo Muruumi, n'omuduumizi waabwe naye n'atya nnyo kubanga yali alagidde okumusiba n'okumukuba kibooko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkeera omuduumizi w'abaserikale bwe yayagala okumanyira ddala ensonga Abayudaaya gye bamulanze, n'asumulula Pawulo mu njegere, n'alagira bakabona abakulu bayite Olukiiko lw'Abayudaaya Olukulu lutuule. N'alagira Pawulo aleetebwe mu Lukiiko ensonga Abayudaaya gye bamuvunaana eryoke etegeerebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
